# Curated package manifest for `bin/dots pac`, the Arch counterpart to Brewfile.
# Sections map to configs/<name>/ and are maintained by add|migrate|remove.
#
# One package name per line, installed with `yay -S --needed`, which covers the
# official repos and the AUR alike. Assumes an Omarchy base install: the 200-odd
# packages in /usr/share/omarchy/install/*.packages are not restated here.

